ype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Cost categories and payers**\n\n| Category | Examples | Payer |\n|---|---|---|\n| One-time | Platform onboarding, prospectus/485 filings, listing, ticker/CUSIP, index setup, launch marketing | Sponsor |\n| Recurring fixed | Platform/trust, admin, custody and TA minimums; audit/tax; board/CCO; annual listing; data; marketing | Sponsor, from unitary fee |\n| Recurring asset-based | Basis-point platform, servicing or index-license fees | Sponsor, from unitary fee |\n| Fund-borne exclusions | Brokerage, taxes, interest, acquired-fund fees, extraordinary/litigation costs | Shareholders, per advisory agreement |\n\n**Seed assets** are invested capital, not expenses. The sponsor recovers them at market value on redemption. Budget only carrying costs: market/hedging risk, financing or opportunity cost, and capital charges.\n\n**Break-even with retained margin**\n\nRequired AUM = F ÷ (f(1−m) − v), valid only if f(1−m) > v.\n\n- F = annual fixed plus amortized one-time costs (USD)\n- f = unitary fee rate\n- v = variable cost rate\n- m = target retained margin as a share of revenue\n\nUse contracted quotes for each input.","ttft_ms":7639,"type":"result","duration_ms":10544,"uuid":"f5aff03e-3b12-448f-8cd0-52fd9846965d","ttft_stream_ms":1054,"time_to_request_ms":49,"first_content_frame_ms":1054,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
